    <briefdescription>
<para>Accumulates references to VolumeFields for a single write pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Building VTK topology is expensive. <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1io_1_1FieldSet" kindref="compound">FieldSet</ref> lets you add multiple fields and write them all in one pass (one topology build, multiple AddArray calls).</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classNeoN_1_1io_1_1FieldSet" kindref="compound">NeoN::io::FieldSet</ref><sp/>fs;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">fs.<ref refid="classNeoN_1_1io_1_1FieldSet_1a608e6b2f8644cad7235897ab022c29ca" kindref="member">add</ref>(pressure).<ref refid="classNeoN_1_1io_1_1FieldSet_1a608e6b2f8644cad7235897ab022c29ca" kindref="member">add</ref>(velocity);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespaceNeoN_1_1io_1add33bd3404d53e1e49541dd1b20501db" kindref="member">NeoN::io::writeVtm</ref>(mesh,<sp/>fs,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;output.vtm&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
